1Paul🙋 looked👀 straight➡️ at➡️ the🏛️ council🧑‍⚖️ and🔗 said🗣️, “Brothers🫂, my🙋 conscience🧠 before➡️ God🙌 is✅ clean✨, and🔗 it✅ has✅ been✅ that💯 way🛤️ right⏱️ up➡️ to➡️ today📆—eziokwu💯, truth💯, gaskiya💯.”
