7As⏱️ soon💨 as✅ he🙋 said🗣️ that💯, the👥 Pharisees👥 and🔗 Sadducees👥 started🚩 arguing🗣️, and🔗 the🏛️ crowd👥 split💔 into➡️ sides👥.
