9The🏛️ room🏛️ erupted📣 into➡️ a💥 loud🔊 argument🗣️. Some💯 legal📜 experts👓 from➡️ the👥 Pharisee✡️ side👥 stood🧍 up⬆️ and🔗 pushed🗣️ back↩️: “We🫂 see👀 no🚫 evil😈 in📍 this💯 man👤. What💬 if💡 a💛 spirit👻 or🔀 an💛 angel👼—un📣 ange👼—really✅ spoke🗣️ to➡️ him🙋? Let’s🫂 not🚫 fight⚔️ against➡️ God🙌.”
10The💥 argument🗣️ got✅ so💯 heated🔥 the👤 commander🪖 feared😨 they👥 might✅ tear💥 Paul🙋 apart🧩. He👤 ordered📣 the👥 soldiers🪖 down⬇️ to➡️ pull🤲 Paul🙋 out🚪 by➡️ force💪 and🔗 bring🚶 him🙋 into➡️ the🏰 barracks🏰.
