15“Here’s💡 the💯 move🕵️,” they👥 said🗣️. “You🫂 and🔗 the🏛️ council🧑‍⚖️ ask🙏 the👤 commander🪖 to➡️ bring🚶 Paul🙋 down⬇️ tomorrow📆, acting🎭 like💭 you🫂 want💭 to➡️ question❓ him🙋 more➕ carefully🔎. We🫂 will✅ be✅ ready💪 to➡️ kill💀 him🙋 before⏱️ he👤 gets✅ here📍.”
