27“This👤 man👤 was✅ seized🤲 by➡️ the👥 Jews✡️, and🔗 they👥 were✅ about⏳ to➡️ kill💀 him🙋. I🙋 arrived🚶 with➡️ my👥 troops🪖 and🔗 rescued🛟 him🙋, after➡️ learning🧠 he🙋 was✅ a💯 Roman🏛️ citizen🪪.
