35he👑 said🗣️, “I🙋 will✅ hear👂 your👤 case⚖️ when⏱️ your👥 accusers🗣️ arrive🚶 too💯.” Then🔜 he👑 ordered📣 Paul🙋 kept🔒 under➡️ guard🛡️ in📍 Herod’s👑 palace🏛️.